@startuml sequence_hitl
' Sequence diagram — HITL checkpoint detail

skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF5FF
  ParticipantBorderColor #1F77B4
  ActorBackgroundColor #FFF7E6
  ActorBorderColor #D2691E
}

actor "Utilisateur\n(reviewer humain)" as User
participant "Manager\nAgent" as Mgr
participant "Synthesis\nTask" as Task
participant "CrewAI\nFramework" as Crew
participant "Gemini 2.5\nFlash" as LLM
participant "AgentLogger" as Log

== Pré-conditions ==
note over Task
  Le manager a déjà reçu :
  - market_research output
  - sentiment_analysis output
  La tâche de synthèse est marquée
  human_input=True dans tasks.yaml.
end note

Mgr -> Task : execute synthesis_task
activate Task
Task -> LLM : compose draft\n(5 sections, 300-500 mots)
LLM --> Task : draft Markdown report

Task -> Crew : task complete with\nhuman_input=True flag
Crew -> User : print(draft)\nprompt: "Anything to add or change?"
note right of User
  L'utilisateur scanne :
  ## 1. Niche Summary
  ## 2. Top Competitors
  ## 3. Sentiment Breakdown
  ## 4. Key Pain Points
  ## 5. Opportunity Recommendation
end note

alt utilisateur approuve (entrée vide ou "approve")
  User --> Crew : "" / "approve" / "looks good"
  Crew -> Log : hitl_checkpoint(summary=draft,\n                  user_feedback="approved")
  Crew --> Task : finalize (no revision)
else utilisateur fournit du feedback
  User --> Crew : "Lower the price range estimate;\nadd a 6th section on regulatory risks"
  Crew -> Log : hitl_checkpoint(summary=draft,\n                  user_feedback="<feedback>")
  Crew -> LLM : revise draft per feedback
  LLM --> Crew : revised Markdown report
  Crew --> Task : finalize (revised)
end

Task --> Mgr : final report
deactivate Task

== Post-conditions ==
note over Mgr
  Le manager retourne le rapport
  validé. main.py l'écrit dans
  outputs/<niche>_<timestamp>.md.
end note
@enduml
